{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 What Kind of Game Is This?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    RPG? Story? Cards? Strategy? Adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    The answer: All of the above\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/extras/2\u670817\u65e5.gif?t=1744616933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Diverse Landscapes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Castles\u00b7Wilderness\u00b7Villages\u00b7Cities\u00b7Churches\u00b7Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area holds unique historical imprints</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter characters\u00b7Rewrite stories\u00b7Gain legacy powers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/extras/2\u670818\u65e5.gif?t=1744616933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Vast Card Collection</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 unique cards with distinct effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Class-specific cards: Tailor attacks to your profession</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable public cards: Fill class weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee mages, tanky hunters, agile berserkers... endless combos await</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/extras/2\u670817\u65e5__1__1_.gif?t=1744616933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Unique Professions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with 5 base classes, grow stronger in Reinhart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barbarian, Hero, Elemental Master, Demolitionist... 40+ professions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No &quot;correct&quot; build\u2014only the perfect synergy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/extras/2\u670819\u65e5.gif?t=1744616933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Dynamic Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster Part Break System: Target weaknesses for advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side-scrolling Movement: Dodge and terrain-based kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faction Dynamics: Turn the tide using rivalries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/extras/f8f70acf44efc1774444327e3dbabada.gif?t=1744616933\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Your Story, Your Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clashing thrones and holy orders, entangled divinity and curses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic vs. technology, chaos and rebirth cycles</p>[p&gt;Ordinary souls struggling against fate's torrent]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice rewrites history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember: Not every tale can be saved</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528190?t=1744616933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528190?t=1744616933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/4e85e6698f79e6b382799f5461a324899623fb2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744616933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528190/4e85e6698f79e6b382799f5461a324899623fb2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744616933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family 